          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Meesho Posts Rs 166 Crore Loss in Q4 FY26 Despite 47% Revenue Jump and 264 Million Active Users",
            "articleSection": "Daily Utility",
            "abstract": "Meesho reported a 47% year-on-year revenue increase in Q4 FY26, supported by 264 million annual transacting users and a 45% rise in order volumes, even as average order values dipped slightly. Despite strong top-line growth, the company remained loss-making with a Rs 166 crore deficit for the quarter, reflecting continued investment in logistics and platform expansion. Meesho's scale makes it one of the largest e-commerce platforms serving price-sensitive consumers in Tier 2 and Tier 3 Indian cities.",
            "url": "https://www.medianama.com/2026/05/223-meesho-posts-rs-166-crore-loss-q4-fy26-revenue-jumps-47/",
